    <string name="about_text">Version %1$s\n\nTips:\n• Double-tap the left or right side to skip back or forward.\n• Double-tap the middle to pause or play.\n• Swipe up or down on the left side for brightness, on the right side for volume.\n• Swipe left or right to move through the video.\n• Pinch with two fingers to zoom.\n• Tap the lock button to block touches while watching.\n• Press Home while a video plays to keep watching in a small window.\n• Open videos from any app with “Open with” → Noor Player.\n• Press Volume Up and Volume Down together to pause or play.\n• Leave the app while a video plays and the sound keeps going; control it from the notification.</string>
